  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: NetworkUpgrade_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 51497bd2ea02b6c4b8fe669147dd7259, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 70813270016
    m_Localized: Red Imp Brewery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1077454618624
    m_Localized: Wild will introduce you to the sales representative of the Red Imp Brewery, allowing you immediate and consistent access to their beer supply. A business card will be given to you to contact this supplier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916352
    m_Localized: Introduction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916353
    m_Localized: Favor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916354
    m_Localized: Informant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916355
    m_Localized: Referral
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916356
    m_Localized: Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916357
    m_Localized: Permit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916358
    m_Localized: Supplier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916359
    m_Localized: Lower Levels Chemist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916360
    m_Localized: Wild will introduce you to a Lower Levels Chemist who produces cheap but illegal drugs for both recreational and medical uses. A business card will be given to you to contact this supplier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916361
    m_Localized: Upper Level Pharmacist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916362
    m_Localized: Wild will introduce you to the Inventory Manager for an unnamed Upper Levels Pharmacist, allowing you immediate and consistent access to legal, but hard to source, medications. A business card will be given to you to contact this supplier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916363
    m_Localized: GP Mining Coop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916364
    m_Localized: Wild will introduce you to the leader of GP Mining Coop, who will allow you to order large amounts of mineral ores. A business card will be given to you to contact this supplier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916365
    m_Localized: Rent Grace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916366
    m_Localized: Wild will convince the Landlord that if you missed a rent payment, it's acceptable to pay the missing rent together with the next week's rent. This is a one time favor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916367
    m_Localized: You are already in the Landlord's good graces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916368
    m_Localized: Clemency
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916369
    m_Localized: Wild will use his political influence to ensure that if a Security Inspector finds contraband that would normally result in imprisonment, you will instead be let off with a warning. This is a one time favor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916370
    m_Localized: Wild has already performed this favor for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916371
    m_Localized: Inspection Early Warning Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916372
    m_Localized: Wild will introduce you to his informant within the Security Department. As long as you pay a nightly fee, the informant will notify you of any regular Security inspection. The informant won't be able to help with any surprise inspections.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916373
    m_Localized: Wild's Fixers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916374
    m_Localized: Wild will allow you to hire his fixers. As long as you pay a nightly fee, the fixers will silence witnesses and clean up evidence not yet collected by Security, lowering your suspected crime level at an increased rate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916375
    m_Localized: Evidence Removal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916376
    m_Localized: Wild will order his security contacts to destroy all collected evidence and tamper with any ongoing investigation against you. This favor has a cooldown of {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916377
    m_Localized: Buyer Referral Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916378
    m_Localized: Wild will agree to refer buyers from his network to your Store, if a nightly fee is paid. Additionally, more customers will be attracted to items in the display case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916379
    m_Localized: Seller Referral Service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916380
    m_Localized: Wild will agree to refer sellers from his network to your Store, if a nightly fee is paid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916381
    m_Localized: Criminal Networking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916382
    m_Localized: Wild will agree to refer high-budget contraband buyers from his network to your Store, if a nightly fee is paid. Using this service also grants you a small amount of Black Market reputation ({0} days cooldown)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916383
    m_Localized: Power Line Hijack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916384
    m_Localized: Your power will be supplied by an external solar panel owned by someone who (probably) doesn't need it. The nightly Power Service is now free. Current Converters are still billed, since the solar panel's output is not enough to run them, but they cost 15% less. Blackouts no longer affect your store or your Current Converters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916385
    m_Localized: Commercial Grade Power Supply Unit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617922916386
    m_Localized: Your power supply unit will be upgraded to accommodate more power. The Recharger and PowerBloc will charge {0}% quicker.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110656
    m_Localized: Showcase Expansion I
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110657
    m_Localized: Your showcase will be expanded to allow more items to be displayed. {0} more customers will be visiting to buy items from the Display Case per day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110658
    m_Localized: Showcase Expansion II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110659
    m_Localized: Your showcase will be expanded even more. {0} additional customers will be visiting to buy item from the Display Case per day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110660
    m_Localized: Gutterflow On Tap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110661
    m_Localized: Wild will connect your water line to a sewer, allowing you access to unlimited Gutterflow. The purity of the water changes every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110662
    m_Localized: Rustwater On Tap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110663
    m_Localized: Wild will connect your water line to an industrial discharge pipe, allowing you access to unlimited Rustwater. The purity of the water changes every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110664
    m_Localized: Ruined Machine Scrapping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110665
    m_Localized: A Junker who will introduce you to scrapping ruined machines for parts will visit you the next day. (Unlocks Ruined Machine Content)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110666
    m_Localized: Retired Farmer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110667
    m_Localized: Immediately receive a Hydroponic Starter Kit. A retired farmer will visit you the next day and, subsequently, once a week, selling seeds and hydroponic equipment. (Unlocks Advanced Farming Content.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110668
    m_Localized: Retired Gunsmith
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110669
    m_Localized: Immediately receive a Gunsmith Starter Kit. A retired gunsmith will visit you the next day and, subsequently, once a week, selling gun mods and ammo. (Unlocks Advanced Gunsmith Content.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110670
    m_Localized: Weapon Permit I
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110671
    m_Localized: Wild will negotiate on your behalf to secure you a firearms permit usually reserved for Lower Level Merchants, allowing you to legally trade low level contraband firearms and ammunition. The permit is delivered once you reach {0} Security Reputation and revoked if it drops below 0. Security lets you keep a shotgun for self defence, once you acquired it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110672
    m_Localized: Weapon Permit II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110673
    m_Localized: Wild will negotiate on your behalf to secure you a firearms permit usually reserved for Upper Level Merchants, allowing you to legally trade mid level contraband firearms and ammunition. The permit will only be delivered after reaching at least {0} Security Reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110674
    m_Localized: Weapon Permit III
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110675
    m_Localized: Wild will negotiate on your behalf to secure you a weapon permit usually reserved for Station Security Quartermasters, allowing you to legally trade high level contraband firearms and ammunition. The permit will only be delivered after reaching at least {0} Security Reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110676
    m_Localized: Retired Chemist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110677
    m_Localized: Immediately receive a Chemist Starter Kit. A retired chemist will visit you the next day and, subsequently, once a week, selling chemical supplies and equipment. (Unlocks Advanced Chemistry Content.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110678
    m_Localized: Water Trading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110679
    m_Localized: Immediately receive a Water Trading Starter Kit. A Water Trader will start visiting the Store. (Unlocks Water Trading Content.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110680
    m_Localized: Marketplace Requests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110681
    m_Localized: Wild will connect you with the Marketplace Request network, allowing you to browse and fulfill various requests from buyers. Rewards for requested items are usually higher than regular market value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110682
    m_Localized: Jackson Investment I
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110683
    m_Localized: Wild will convince Dr. Jackson to accept a small investment from you, permanently increasing his budget, and the available stock when visiting him. Dr. Jackson will always have Modules in stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110684
    m_Localized: Jackson Investment II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110685
    m_Localized: Wild will convince Dr. Jackson to accept another investment from you, permanently increasing his budget, and the available stock when visiting him. Dr. Jackson will always have additional Modules in stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110686
    m_Localized: Store Renovation I
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110687
    m_Localized: Wild will hire contractors to make modest renovations to the Store, improving its base attractiveness by {0} points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110688
    m_Localized: Store Renovation II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110689
    m_Localized: Wild will hire contractors to make substantial renovations to the Store, improving its base attractiveness by another {0} points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110690
    m_Localized: Store Renovation III
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5617927110691
    m_Localized: Wild will hire contractors to make transformative renovations to the Store, improving its base attractiveness by another {0} points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14152759671308288
    m_Localized: Ranching
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14152759692279808
    m_Localized: Wild will refer you to a Rat Rancher who will visit you once a week. Immediately receive a Rat Ranching Starter Kit. (Unlock Rancher Content)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38007088798810112
    m_Localized: Retired Winemaker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38007088832364544
    m_Localized: Immediately receive a Winemaking Starter Kit. A retired winemaker will visit you the next day and, subsequently, once a week, selling winemaking supplies and equipment. (Unlocks Winemaking Content.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84458081375535104
    m_Localized: Aquaculture
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84458081438449664
    m_Localized: Wild will refer you to a retired aquafarmer who will visit you once a week, selling fish farming equipment and fertilized roe. Immediately receive an Aquaculture Starter Kit. (Unlocks Aquaculture Content.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84884217368723456
    m_Localized: Aquaculture II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84884217402277888
    m_Localized: The retired aquafarmer will also bring bigger, more profitable fish to raise on each visit. Immediately receive two young eels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919055683584
    m_Localized: Plant Genetics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238016
    m_Localized: Immediately receive a DNA manipulator, a gene scanner and blank DNA data disks. Dr. Jackson will now keep DNA manipulation equipment in stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238017
    m_Localized: Upgraded Dossier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238018
    m_Localized: Expand the size of the dossier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238019
    m_Localized: Upgraded Trash Can
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238020
    m_Localized: Expand the size of the trash can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238021
    m_Localized: Vending Machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238022
    m_Localized: A vending machine will be immediately installed in the store. Allowing goods to be sold during the night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238023
    m_Localized: Vending Fountain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238024
    m_Localized: A vending fountain will be immediately installed in the store. Allowing water to be sold during the night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 86607919089238025
    m_Localized: Store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254073679872
    m_Localized: 'Minor Shareholder: Red Imp Brewery'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428608
    m_Localized: Buy a minor share of the Red Imp Brewery. Their courier's wholesale discount grows by {0}%, and every Thursday morning a dividend of {1} case of beer is waiting on the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428609
    m_Localized: 'Minor Shareholder: GP Mining Coop'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428610
    m_Localized: Buy a minor share of the GP Mining Coop. Their courier's wholesale discount grows by {0}%, and every Friday morning a dividend of {1} ore is waiting on the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428611
    m_Localized: 'Minor Shareholder: Lower Levels Chemist'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428612
    m_Localized: Buy a minor share of the Lower Levels Chemist's operation. Their courier's wholesale discount grows by {0}%, and every Saturday morning a dividend of {1} street grade Dream Dust is waiting on the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428613
    m_Localized: 'Minor Shareholder: Upper Level Pharmacist'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428614
    m_Localized: Buy a minor share of the Upper Level Pharmacist's practice. Their courier's wholesale discount grows by {0}%, and every Sunday morning a dividend of {1} Oxymore injectors is waiting on the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428615
    m_Localized: Monday's Special Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88049254111428616
    m_Localized: Dr. Jackson opens on Mondays for you alone, offering a special stock of rarer items at a premium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592013217792
    m_Localized: Hypertech Smuggler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577920
    m_Localized: Joe Wild refers you to a smuggler who deals in Hypertech items, technology far beyond what the station's industry can produce. Unlocks the Hypertech Smuggler nightly service.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577921
    m_Localized: Endorsement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577922
    m_Localized: Wild's Endorsement I
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577923
    m_Localized: Joe Wild personally endorses your store. Visiting customers have {0}% more budget to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577924
    m_Localized: Wild's Endorsement II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577925
    m_Localized: Joe Wild talks up your store to his best contacts. Visiting customers have another {0}% more budget to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577926
    m_Localized: Wild's Endorsement III
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577927
    m_Localized: Joe Wild puts his own name behind your store. Visiting customers have another {0}% more budget to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577928
    m_Localized: Wild's Fixers II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577929
    m_Localized: Wild assigns you his more experienced fixers. They clear evidence faster, so your suspected crime level drops more each night. The nightly fee increases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577930
    m_Localized: Wild's Fixers III
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93775592042577931
    m_Localized: Wild puts his best crew on your store. Witnesses forget, evidence disappears, and your suspected crime level drops even faster each night. The nightly fee increases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95679291312619520
    m_Localized: Power Line Hijack II
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95679291337785344
    m_Localized: 'Wild''s crew splices a bigger solar array into your line. It now carries part of your Current Converters'' load: they cost {0}% less to run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95679291337785345
    m_Localized: Power Line Hijack III
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95679291337785346
    m_Localized: Wild's crew taps a whole rooftop of panels for you. Your Current Converters now cost {0}% less to run in total.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
